VanguardSpears: {
	Controls:
		'''
		Left-click thrusts forward and retracts at constant speed. Hits release small falling sparks that deal damage.
		The reserve above your head fills from empty in {1} seconds while held. Each direct melee hit adds 20%.
		Right-click spends a full reserve to throw one heavy javelin dealing {0}x damage.
		The first heavy-javelin hit releases 6 to 9 sparks, each dealing 10% of its damage.
		Melee hits throw 1 to 3 sparks forward at random, each dealing 18% of that thrust's damage.
		Sparks scatter then fall, become damaging after 5 frames, and hit up to 5 times total with a 15-frame cooldown per enemy.
		Throws, sparks and follow-up strikes do not refill the shared reserve. Recovery pauses when unequipped; death clears it.
		'''
	SkillKey: Press [{0}] for manual skills; click a skill icon to select it.
	Unbound: Bind Skill Activate under Settings → Controls → Mod Controls.
	Placeholder: Weapon art and skill icons temporarily reuse existing mod assets.
}

